  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Legendary low-top Nike Dunk design with a lightly padded tongue and collarAllover suede upper feels soft and breathable with a luxurious appearanceSignature Swoosh on the sides and Nike detailing at the tongue and heelLace closure secures the fitPerforations along the toe enhance breathability and aid comfortFoam midsole offers lightweight, responsive cushioningRubber outsole with classic pivot circle adds durable traction and heritage styleThe Nike Dunk Low Retro SE Casual Shoes are imported.Premium materials, a monochromatic look, and an iconic silhouette come together on the Nike Dunk Low Retro SE Casual Shoes for an updated classic you can always count on. Its low-profile silhouette and oh-so-soft suede upper lend a modern lifestyle look to the old-school hoops design, adding a perfect touch to your look for a certified banger in your kicks collection.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike Dunk Low Retro SE Suede Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Black/Black</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3424285</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n<